{"seq":1,"slug":"wave-function-collapse","title":"波函数坍缩与约束求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/search-grammar/wave-function-collapse","wordCount":1527,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"波函数坍缩与约束求解\">波函数坍缩与约束求解</h1><p>2016 年 Maxim Gumin 在 GitHub 放出一个叫 WaveFunctionCollapse 的算法，配图是一张由几十种小瓷砖自动拼成、却处处接缝完美的像素小镇——独立开发者圈子瞬间被点燃。这个借了量子力学名字的算法，其实和量子毫无关系，但它精准命中了 <a href=\"../foundations/randomness-noise\">随机性与噪声函数</a> 解决不了的痛点：噪声管不了&quot;这块瓷砖的右边只能接得上图案的瓷砖&quot;这种局部一致性约束。WFC 把生成变成一个约束满足问题，这是 PCG 从&quot;碰运气&quot;走向&quot;有保证&quot;的标志性方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WFC 借用了波函数的比喻：每个待填的格子一开始处于所有可能瓷砖的&quot;叠加态&quot;，算法逐步&quot;坍缩&quot;——选一个格子定下具体瓷砖——并把这个决定的约束&quot;传播&quot;到邻居，删掉它们里不再可能的选项。如此循环直到所有格子都坍缩，或某格选项被删空（矛盾，需回溯或重启）。</p>\n<p>它的输入有两种风格：瓦片式（tiled model）——人工指定瓷砖集与邻接规则；重叠式（overlapping model）——只给一张样例图，算法自动从中提取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的图块及其邻接关系，从而&quot;模仿&quot;样例的局部风格生成无限大的同风格图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[初始化: 每格=所有瓷砖叠加态] --&gt; B[找熵最低的格子]&#10;  B --&gt; C[按权重随机坍缩为一个瓷砖]&#10;  C --&gt; D[向邻居传播约束&lt;br/&gt;删除不兼容选项]&#10;  D --&gt; E{有格子选项空了?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是: 矛盾| F[回溯或重启]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G{还有未坍缩格?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| B&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[完成]&#10;  F --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[初始化: 每格=所有瓷砖叠加态] --&gt; B[找熵最低的格子]\n  B --&gt; C[按权重随机坍缩为一个瓷砖]\n  C --&gt; D[向邻居传播约束&lt;br/&gt;删除不兼容选项]\n  D --&gt; E{有格子选项空了?}\n  E --&gt;|是: 矛盾| F[回溯或重启]\n  E --&gt;|否| G{还有未坍缩格?}\n  G --&gt;|是| B\n  G --&gt;|否| H[完成]\n  F --&gt; B</pre><p>下表对比两种 WFC 模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>邻接规则来源</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>瓦片式</td>\n<td>瓷砖集+手写邻接</td>\n<td>设计师指定</td>\n<td>关卡、棋盘、明确规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重叠式</td>\n<td>一张样例图</td>\n<td>自动从样例提取</td>\n<td>模仿风格、纹理合成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"熵驱动的坍缩顺序\">熵驱动的坍缩顺序</h2><p>WFC 不是随便挑格子坍缩，而是优先坍缩&quot;最确定&quot;的格子——即剩余可能瓷砖最少、香农熵最低的格子。直觉是：在选项最少的地方下决定，犯错（导致矛盾）的概率最小。</p>\n<p>每个格子的熵按其剩余可能瓷砖的权重计算。若格子还能放瓷砖集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，每个瓷砖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 有出现权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该格熵为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = \\log\\left(\\sum_{i \\in S} w_i\\right) - \\frac{\\sum_{i \\in S} w_i \\log w_i}{\\sum_{i \\in S} w_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4802em;vertical-align:-1.0131em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4671em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0131em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制每种瓷砖出现的相对频率——在重叠式里它直接来自样例图中各图块的出现次数，所以生成结果会保持样例的统计风格（草地多、房子少）。这个&quot;按权重控频率&quot;是 WFC 少有的可控旋钮，对应 <a href=\"../foundations/controllability-evaluation\">可控性与质量评估</a> 里的参数控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束传播-弧一致性\">约束传播：弧一致性</h2><p>坍缩一个格子后，必须把后果传播出去，否则会留下不兼容的邻接。WFC 的传播本质是约束满足问题（CSP）里的弧一致性（arc consistency）算法 AC-3：维护一个待处理队列，每次取出一个格子，检查它的每个邻居——若邻居的某个候选瓷砖在当前格子的所有候选里都找不到合法邻接，就删掉该候选；任何被删了候选的邻居重新入队，连锁传播下去。</p>\n<p>这个传播过程是 WFC 慢的根源：一次坍缩可能引发大面积的连锁删除。2025 年的研究正是针对这点做混合优化——例如把 WFC 与遗传算法结合的混合框架，在 Unity 实验中报告比单用 WFC 收敛快 56%、不可玩关卡减少 73%（<a href=\"https://www.iccs-meeting.org/archive/iccs2025/papers/159090105.pdf\">ICCS 2025</a>）。把 WFC 当约束求解器、把遗传算法当全局优化器，正好弥补 WFC&quot;只保证局部一致、不保证全局可玩&quot;的短板——这与 <a href=\"search-based-pcg\">基于搜索的生成与演化</a> 的思路直接相连。</p>\n<h2 id=\"矛盾-回溯与确定性\">矛盾、回溯与确定性</h2><p>WFC 最棘手的工程问题是矛盾（contradiction）：传播后某个格子的候选被删空，意味着无解。处理策略有三种取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重启</td>\n<td>整张图推倒重来</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>大图浪费严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回溯</td>\n<td>撤销最近若干次坍缩</td>\n<td>不全废</td>\n<td>实现复杂、可能很慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束放松</td>\n<td>允许局部用&quot;通配&quot;瓷砖</td>\n<td>永不失败</td>\n<td>可能出瑕疵</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>设计良好的瓷砖邻接规则能大幅降低矛盾率——这其实把难度从算法转移到了内容设计，是 WFC 实践里最吃经验的部分。另外，WFC 用的随机数若由固定种子驱动（见 <a href=\"../foundations/randomness-noise\">随机性与噪声函数</a>），整个坍缩过程就完全确定可复现，这对调试和运行时分块生成都至关重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其它方法的边界\">与其它方法的边界</h2><p>WFC 擅长局部一致性强、风格统一的内容：纹理、瓷砖地图、装饰性关卡、像素小镇。但它有两个天然短板。其一，它只保证局部邻接合法，不保证全局性质——它不知道&quot;出口必须可达&quot;，所以对必要内容（见 <a href=\"../foundations/pcg-overview\">PCG 概念与分类</a>）往往要配 <a href=\"../foundations/controllability-evaluation\">可控性与质量评估</a> 里的可解性校验，或像上面那样套一层搜索。其二，它的可控性较弱——除了瓷砖权重和预放置约束（pre-collapse 某些格子作为硬约束），设计师很难精确引导。当你需要的是&quot;按高层规则生长出结构&quot;而非&quot;按邻接拼瓷砖&quot;时，形式语法是更自然的工具，那是下一篇 <a href=\"grammar-rule-systems\">语法与规则系统</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WFC 把生成建模为约束满足问题：每格是瓷砖叠加态，逐步坍缩并传播约束直到全图自洽。</li>\n<li>两种模型：瓦片式手写邻接规则，重叠式从一张样例图自动提取邻接并模仿其风格。</li>\n<li>坍缩优先选香农熵最低的格子，瓷砖权重控制出现频率，是 WFC 主要的可控旋钮。</li>\n<li>约束传播本质是 AC-3 弧一致性，连锁删除是 WFC 慢的根源，2025 年常用混合算法优化。</li>\n<li>矛盾处理有重启/回溯/约束放松三种取舍，良好的瓷砖规则设计能大幅降低矛盾率。</li>\n<li>WFC 保证局部一致而非全局可玩，必要内容须配可解性校验或套一层搜索来弥补。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"波函数坍缩与约束求解","id":"波函数坍缩与约束求解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"熵驱动的坍缩顺序","id":"熵驱动的坍缩顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"约束传播：弧一致性","id":"约束传播-弧一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"矛盾、回溯与确定性","id":"矛盾-回溯与确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"与其它方法的边界","id":"与其它方法的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"城市与道路网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/terrain-space/city-road-networks"},"next":{"title":"语法与规则系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/procedural-content-generation/search-grammar/grammar-rule-systems"}}